00:35:29.870 --> 00:35:34.430
And the two other [INAUDIBLE],,
what we have seen so far

00:35:34.430 --> 00:35:36.320
is the auto scaling.

00:35:36.320 --> 00:35:38.060
Auto scaling is not available.

00:35:38.060 --> 00:35:41.510
I mean, it's not so easy
