00:35:41.510 --> 00:35:47.090
And then the cost--

00:35:47.090 --> 00:35:48.630
OK, it's not cost-effective.

00:35:48.630 --> 00:35:51.320
If you are fixed
with 100 nodes, you

00:35:51.320 --> 00:35:53.960
have to continue to
