00:36:03.980 --> 00:36:06.740
here, this has
been made possible

00:36:06.740 --> 00:36:09.350
because we used
Stackdriver on GCP.

00:36:09.350 --> 00:36:13.050
So we collect the metrics
at the granular level.

00:36:13.050 --> 00:36:15.660
And this is in fact a
