00:36:34.010 --> 00:36:35.750
Now, we don't have to worry.

00:36:35.750 --> 00:36:37.160
We have a small dev ops team.

00:36:37.160 --> 00:36:38.780
And they are now relieved.

00:36:38.780 --> 00:36:43.310
And Mahadevan can spend more
